      "message": "Don\u0027t use `check_output`, it\u0027s deprecated since Python 3.5 in favor of `subprocess.run`.\n\nInstead, you want:\n\n```\nbazel_bin \u003d subprocess.run(\n   ...,\n   check\u003dTrue,\n   stdout\u003dsubprocess.PIPE,\n   encoding\u003d\"utf-8\",\n)\n```\n\nI would also add `cwd\u003dPath(__file__).parent` in here just in case someone is running this cmd outside the bazel workspace.",
